Package: tumoronly
Title: Traceable Tumor-Only Somatic Variant Filtering and Reporting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mariana", "Boroni", email = "marianaboroni@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Mariana Boroni [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Mariana Boroni <marianaboroni@gmail.com>
Description: A reproducible pipeline for tumor-only variant filtering,
    classification, and reporting. It ingests VCF, MAF, TSV, TXT, and gzipped
    variant files; validates the input schema and genome build; applies
    documented fail-safe tumor-only filters; scores technical, population,
    artifact, and somatic-candidate evidence; writes traceable per-variant
    explanations; and generates tables, figures, manifests, and an HTML report.
    Tumor-only classifications are probabilistic candidates and are not
    clinical confirmation without matched-normal or orthogonal validation.
